helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the language for the selected text. \<br/\>Click to open a menu where you can choose another language for the selected text or for the current paragraph. \<br/\>Choose None to exclude the text from spellchecking and hyphenation. \<br/\>Choose Reset to Default Language to re-apply the default language for the selection or the paragraph. \<br/\>Choose More to open a dialog with more options.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
