helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3666188				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The View Layout icons show from left to right: Single column mode. View mode with pages side by side. Book mode with two pages as in an open book.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
