helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0212.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	ga	The filtered data view is active until you change or cancel the sorting or filtering criteria. If a filter is active, the \<emph\>Apply Filter\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Table Data\</emph\> bar is activated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
