helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167				0	ga	Fields are used to insert information about the current document, for example, file name, template, statistics, user data, date, and time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470				0	ga	For the HTML export and import of date and time fields, \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090007.xhp#datumuhrzeit\" name=\"special $[officename] formats\"\>special $[officename] formats\</link\> are used.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151312				0	ga	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153672	5			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKTYPE\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The following fields are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182				0	ga	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3143272				0	ga	Meaning				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248				0	ga	Údar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148975	11			0	ga	Inserts the name of the current user. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145759				0	ga	Chapter				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149172				0	ga	Inserts the chapter number and/or the chapter name.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	ga	Dáta				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	ga	Inserts the current date. You can insert the date as a fixed field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date (fixed)\</item\> - that does not change, or as a dynamic field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date\</item\> - that it is updated automatically. To manually update the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date\</item\> field, press F9.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	ga	File name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	ga	Inserts the filename and/or the directory path of the current document, as well as the filename without extension.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
