helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154867				0	ga	If you choose "Chapter number without separator" for a chapter field, the separators that are specified for chapter number in \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06060000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Outline numbering\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Outline numbering\</emph\>\</link\> are not displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
