helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_idN10772				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"878711313\"\>Opens a file open dialog where you can select a database file (*.odb). The selected file is added to the Databases Selection list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
