helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	ga	Specify the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06180000.xhp\" name=\"Line numbering\"\>Line numbering\</link\> options. To add line numbers to your document, choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
