helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3151184				0	ga	To define an index key, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Insert Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Insert Index Entry\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
