helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10561				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Excludes the current recipient from this mail merge.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10564				0	ga	Cuir Cáipéis in Eagar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge06.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Minimizes the wizard so that you can edit the main mail merge document for all recipients.\</ahelp\> To return to the wizard, click the \<emph\>Return to Mail Merge Wizard\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge06.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056F				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge07.xhp\" name=\"Mail Merge Wizard - Personalize document\"\>Mail Merge Wizard - Personalize document\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Footnote/Endnote				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143276				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Edit  Footnotes\"\>Footnote/Endnote\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149097				0	ga	\<variable id=\"fusstext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditFootnote\"\>Edits the selected footnote or endnote anchor. Click in front of the footnote or endnote, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149035				0	ga	To edit the text of a footnote or endnote, click in the footnote area at the bottom of the page, or at the end of the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145776				0	ga	To quickly jump to the footnote or endnote text, click the anchor for note in the document. You can also position the cursor in front of or behind the marker, and then press Ctrl+Shift+PgDn. To jump back to the anchor for the note, press PgUp.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155916				0	ga	Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151373				0	ga	Select the numbering type for the footnote or endnote.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150685				0	ga	Auto				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155858				0	ga	Character				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149849				0	ga	To change the format of a footnote or endnote anchor or text, select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>. You can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+T\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>F11\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window and modify the footnote or endnote paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153296				0	ga	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153308				0	ga	Select the type of note to insert, that is, footnote or endnote. A footnote is placed at the bottom of the current page, whereas an endnote is placed at the end of the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
