helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145782				0	ga	Change page number				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:DLG_BREAK:CB_PAGENUM\"\>Assigns the page number that you specify to the page that follows the manual page break. This option is only available if you assign a different page style to the page that follows manual page break.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
