helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3148863				0	ga	<SDFIELD TYPE=DOCINFO SUBTYPE=COMMENT SDFIXED>Description</SDFIELD>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
