helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3149708				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FRM_ADD\"\>Specifies properties for the selected object, graphic or frame.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151183				0	ga	Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3147568				0	ga	Specifies the name of the selected item, and associated links.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151178				0	ga	Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3147510				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FRM_ADD:ED_NAME\"\>Enter a name for the selected item.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154565				0	ga	Assign an object, graphic or frame a meaningful name, so that you can quickly locate it afterwards in long documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153674				0	ga	Alternative text (floating frames, graphics, and objects only)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150977				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FRM_ADD:ED_ALT_NAME\"\>Enter the text to display in a web browser when the selected item is unavailable. Alternate text is also used to assist people with disabilities.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155903				0	ga	Previous link				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154192				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FRM_ADD_LB_PREV\"\>Displays the item (object, graphic, or frame) that comes before the current item in a linked sequence. To add or change the previous link, select a name from the list. If you are linking frames, the current frame and the target frame must be empty.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159198				0	ga	Next link				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3149485				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FRM_ADD_LB_NEXT\"\>Displays the item (object, graphic, or frame) that comes after the current item in a linked sequence. To add or change the next link, select a name from the list. If you are a linking frames, the target frame must be empty.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143280				0	ga	Protect				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154834				0	ga	Specifies protection options for the selected item.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
