helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3151374	32			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_FRM_ADD_LB_TEXTFLOW\"\>Specifies the preferred text flow direction in a frame. To use the default text flow settings for the page, select \<emph\>Use superordinate object settings \</emph\>from the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150689				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05040200.xhp\" name=\"Text direction\"\>Text direction\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
