helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167	2			0	ga	\<variable id=\"fussnoteein\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertFootnote\"\>Inserts a footnote or an endnote in the document. The anchor for the note is inserted at the current cursor position.\</ahelp\> You can choose between automatic numbering or a custom symbol. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154645	23			0	ga	\<variable id=\"endnoten\"\>The following applies to both footnotes and endnotes. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151175	24			0	ga	\<variable id=\"endnotetext\"\>Footnotes are inserted at the end of a page, and endnotes are inserted at the end of a document. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154106				0	ga	Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149812				0	ga	Select the type of numbering that you want to use for footnotes and endnotes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
