helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3153532				0	ga	Level "S" refers to the single letter headings that divide the index entries alphabetically. To enable these headings, select the \<emph\>Alphabetical delimiter\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
