helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150249				0	ga	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\".uno:Repaginate\"\>Updates the page formats in the document and recalculates the total number of pages that is displayed on the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
