helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153532				0	ga	When you add chapter numbers to caption labels, the caption numbering is reset when a chapter heading is encountered. For example, if the last figure in chapter 1 is "Figure 1.12", the first figure in the next chapter would be "Figure 2.1".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
