helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149504	272			0	ga	If no whole cell is selected, the text from the cursor to the end of the current sentence is deleted. If the cursor is at the end of a cell, and no whole cell is selected, the contents of the next cell are deleted. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
