helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	12			0	ga	Index entries are inserted as fields into your document. To view fields in your document, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View\</item\>         \<emph/\>and ensure that \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Field Shadings\</item\>         \<emph/\>is selected. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
