helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	ga	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> icon and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\>               \<emph/\>from the submenu				2002-02-02 02:02:02
