helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	ga	Click the icon of the style category that you want to create.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154851				0	ga	Select at least one character, or object, in the style that you want to copy. For page and frame styles, select at least one character or object in the page or frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
