helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	ga	You can quickly apply styles, such as paragraph and character styles, in your document by using the Fill Format Mode in the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
