helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149574				0	ga	To Change the Width of a Column				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156246				0	ga	Rest the mouse pointer over the column dividing line until the pointer becomes a separator icon, and then drag the line to a new location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145390				0	ga	Rest the mouse pointer over the column dividing line on the ruler until the pointer becomes a separator icon, and then drag the line to a new location.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149993				0	ga	To Change the Width of a Cell				2002-02-02 02:02:02
