helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D9				0	ga	Press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Backspace\</item\> key to delete the number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155552				0	ga	To Use a Custom Paragraph Style as a Heading				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155571				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\>               \<emph/\>tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147758				0	ga	Select the custom style in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
