helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582				0	ga	Right-click a text file in any of the two lists, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Reset Default Template - Text Document\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3156245				0	ga	Click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
