helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149695				0	ga	\<variable id=\"number_sequence\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/number_sequence.xhp\" name=\"Defining Number Ranges\"\>Defining Number Ranges\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918				0	ga	You can automatically number similar items, such as quotations, in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	ga	Type the text that you want to assign numbering to, for example, "Quotation Number ".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155048				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\>               \<emph/\>tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	ga	Click "Number range" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\>               \<emph/\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	ga	Type "Quotation" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\>               \<emph/\>box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3153387				0	ga	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	ga	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
