helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150210				0	ga	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Manual Break\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150235				0	ga	Select \<emph\>Page break\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150939				0	ga	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\>               \<emph/\>box, select the page style that you want to apply to the page that follows the manual break.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150965				0	ga	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
