helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN10700				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id6953622\" src=\"res/helpimg/dircursright.png\" width=\"0.1563in\" height=\"0.3228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6953622\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> Align right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	ga	Type your text. %PRODUCTNAME automatically inserts the required number of blank lines, and, if the options are enabled, tabs and spaces.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
