helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154250				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>turning off automatic correction\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text;turning off automatic correction\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>uppercase;changing to lowercase\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>capital letters;changing to small letters after periods\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>quotation marks;changing automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>words;automatic replacement on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines;automatic drawing on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>underlining;quick\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>borders; automatic drawing on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic changes on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>changes;automatic\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>AutoCorrect function;turning off\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147812				0	ga	\<variable id=\"auto_off\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/auto_off.xhp\" name=\"Turning Off AutoFormat and AutoCorrect\"\>Turning Off AutoCorrect\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147833	2			0	ga	By default, $[officename] automatically corrects many common typing errors and applies formatting while you type. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081B				0	ga	To quickly undo an automatic correction or completion, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN10846				0	ga	To turn off most AutoCorrect features, remove the check mark from the menu \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - While Typing\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147251				0	ga	To Remove a Word from the AutoCorrect List				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3147274				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145620				0	ga	In the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list, select the word pair that you want to remove.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145645				0	ga	Click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145668				0	ga	To Stop Replacing Quotation Marks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151196				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151220				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Localized Options\</emph\> tab				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3151245				0	ga	Clear the "Replace" check box(es).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155076				0	ga	To Stop Capitalizing the First Letter of a Sentence				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155099	10			0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155123				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155148				0	ga	Clear the "Capitalize first letter of every sentence" check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
