helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155415				0	ga	$[officename] automatically draws a line when you type three of the following characters and press Enter: - _ = * ~ #				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3155439				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
