helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	ga	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click ”Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\>               \<emph/\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
