helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533	105			0	ga	In the \<emph\>With Condition\</emph\> box, type \<emph\>user_lastname == "Doe"\</emph\>, where "Doe" is the last name of the user that you want to hide the text from. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3155573				0	ga	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then save the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
