helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153899				0	ga	\<variable id=\"calculate_intext2\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_intext2.xhp\" name=\"Displaying the Result of a Table Calculation in a Different Table\"\>Displaying the Result of a Table Calculation in a Different Table\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250				0	ga	You can perform a calculation on cells in one table and display the result in a different table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	ga	Open a text document, insert a table with multiple columns and rows, and then insert another table consisting of one cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150528				0	ga	Enter numbers into some of the cells of the large table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	ga	Place the cursor in the table with the single cell, and then press F2.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155551				0	ga	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formula Bar\</item\>, enter the function that you want to perform, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>=SUM\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	ga	Click in a cell in the larger table that contains a number, press the plus sign (+), and then click in a different cell containing a number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3155598				0	ga	Press \<emph\>Enter\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	ga	If you want, you can format the table to behave as normal text. Insert the table into a frame, and then anchor the frame as a character. The frame remains anchored to the adjacent text when you insert or delete text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Automatically Check Spelling				2002-02-02 02:02:02
