helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	ga	Print layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156276				0	ga	The HTML filter supports CSS2 (Cascading Style Sheets Level 2) for printing documents. These capabilities are only effective if print layout export is activated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144764				0	ga	Copy local graphics to Internet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
