helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146898	39			0	ga	If the \<emph\>Graphics and objects \</emph\>option is not selected, no graphics will be loaded from the Internet. Graphics within a table and without an indication of their size can cause display problems when using an older HTML standard on the browsed page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
