helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	ga	In this section you can delimit the number of approximation steps carried out during iterative calculations. In addition, you can specify the degree of precision of the answer.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
