helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149568				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:NUMERICFIELD:RID_SCPAGE_CALC:ED_PREC\"\>Defines the number of decimals to be displayed for numbers with the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> number format. The numbers are displayed as rounded numbers, but are not saved as rounded numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145150				0	ga	Precision as shown				2002-02-02 02:02:02
