helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944	5			0	ga	In the right color window, you will see the entire color spectrum from the left to the right, with the colors at the top being fully saturated and the colors at the bottom being unsaturated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670	6			0	ga	In the left color window, you will see a selection of colors, displaying a progressive spectrum, varying between the four colors in the four corners of this window. You can change the colors in the four corners as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758	7			0	ga	Click the corner of the field in which you want to change the color.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398	8			0	ga	In the right color window, click the desired new color for the corner field or enter the values, which define the color, in the numeric input fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210	9			0	ga	Apply the color selected on the right to the small field that is marked in the left color window by clicking the \<emph\><--\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383	10			0	ga	The gradient in the left color window is immediately adjusted with respect to hue, saturation, and brightness.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id9701528				0	ga	%PRODUCTNAME uses only the RGB color model for printing in color. The CMYK controls are provided only to ease the input of color values using CMYK notation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153192	11			0	ga	<--				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909	12			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SVTOOLS:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_COLOR:BTN_1\"\>Click the \<emph\><--\</emph\> button to replace the selected color in the color palette with the color selected at the right. The button is enabled when you select a color in one of the four corners.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158409	13			0	ga	-->				2002-02-02 02:02:02
