helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159252				0	ga	Úsáid méadraigh phrintéara le haghaidh formáidiú téacs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145366				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_LAYOUT_CB_TEXTFMT\"\>Specifies that printer metrics are applied for printing and also for formatting the display on the screen.\</ahelp\> If this box is not checked, a printer independent layout will be used for screen display and printing.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
