helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056A				0	ga	The Macro Security dialog appears when a document contains one or more macros. You can also call the dialog from the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01030300.xhp\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Security\</link\>\</emph\> page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
