helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010401.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	ga	Mark all modules that are to be activated for this language under the headings Spelling, Hyphenation and Thesaurus.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010401.xhp	0	help	par_id3154923				0	ga	As long as you have more than one sub-module available for one area, the sub-modules for spelling and the Thesaurus are processed in the sequence in which they are listed. You can change the sequence using the \<emph\>Move Up\</emph\> and \<emph\>Move Down\</emph\> buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010401.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	ga	Only one sub-module can be activated under Hyphenation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
