helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10981				0	ga	Add paragraph and table spacing at tops of pages (in current document)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10985				0	ga	Add paragraph and table spacing at bottom of table cells				2002-02-02 02:02:02
