helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150983				0	ga	Seiceáil focail atá sa chás uachtair				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582				0	ga	Specifies that capitalization is checked during spellcheck.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
