helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208				0	ga	Specifies that words that contain numbers as well as letters are to be checked.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147509				0	ga	Seiceáil an ceannlitriú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154200				0	ga	Checks for the correct use of capitals at the start of words during spellcheck.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166424				0	ga	Seiceáil réigiúin speisialta				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345				0	ga	Specifies that special regions, such as drawing text, are checked during spellcheck.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166429				0	ga	Seiceáil litriú le linn clóscríofa				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531				0	ga	\<variable id=\"automatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpellOnline\"\>Automatically checks spelling as you type, and underlines errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291				0	ga	Typing errors are highlighted in the document with a red underline. If you place the cursor over a word marked in this way, you can open the context menu to obtain a list of corrections. Select a correction to replace the word. If you make the same mistake again while editing the document, it will be marked as an error again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815				0	ga	To place the word pair in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect replacement table\"\>AutoCorrect replacement table\</link\>, open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040500.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect context menu\"\>AutoCorrect context menu\</link\> and choose \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\>. Make your selection from the submenu. The word is replaced and at the same time the word pair is placed in the replacement table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150111	53			0	ga	Minimal number of characters for hyphenation 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150316				0	ga	Specifies the minimum number of characters required for automatic hyphenation to be applied. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_LNGDLG_NUM_PREBREAK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\> Type the minimum number of characters that must come before or after the hyphen.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148823				0	ga	Characters before line break				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156029				0	ga	Sets the minimum number of characters of the word to be hyphenated that must remain at the end of the line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154956				0	ga	Characters after line break				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149439				0	ga	Specifies the minimum number of characters of a hyphenated word required at the next line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156337				0	ga	Fleiscínigh gan cheist				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151130				0	ga	Specifies that you will never be asked for a manual hyphenation. If the field is not marked, when a word is not recognized you will be presented with a dialog for entering hyphens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
