helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147348				0	ga	Comment indicator				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_ANNOT\"\>Specifies that a small rectangle in the top right corner of the cell indicates that a comment exists. The comment will be shown only when you enable tips under \<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\> in the Options dialog box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150487				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NoteVisible\"\>To display a comment permanently, select the \<emph\>Show comment\</emph\> command from the cell's context menu.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	ga	You can type and edit comments with the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04050000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Comment\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Comment\</emph\>\</link\> command. Comments that are permanently displayed can be edited by clicking the comment box. Click the Navigator and under the \<emph\>Comments\</emph\> entry you can view all comments in the current document. By double clicking a comment in Navigator, the cursor will jump to the corresponding cell containing the comment.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150872				0	ga	Value highlighting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154792				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_VALUE\"\>Mark the \<emph\>Value highlighting\</emph\> box to show the cell contents in different colors, depending on type. Text cells are formatted in black, formulas in green, and number cells in blue, no matter how their display is formatted.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151319				0	ga	When this command is active, any colors assigned in the document will not be displayed until the function is deactivated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157846				0	ga	Ancaire				2002-02-02 02:02:02
