helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146898				0	ga	Text overflow				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_CLIP\"\>If a cell contains text that is wider than the width of the cell, the text is displayed over empty neighboring cells in the same row. If there is no empty neighboring cell, a small triangle at the cell border indicates that the text continues.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
