helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154621				0	ga	Print				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	ga	\<variable id=\"druckentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Print\"\>Prints the current document, selection, or the pages that you specify. You can also set the print options for the current document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The printing options can vary according to the printer and the operating system that you use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912284853				0	ga	The Print dialog consists of three main parts: A preview with navigation buttons, several tab pages with control elements specific to the current document type, and the Print, Cancel, and Help buttons. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200901193992				0	ga	If you just want to know how to print your document, click any of the following links.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531416				0	ga	\<emph\>Printing text documents:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531487				0	ga	\<emph\>Printing spreadsheets:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531410				0	ga	\<emph\>Printing presentations:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912531449				0	ga	\<emph\>General printing:\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912284952				0	ga	The settings that you define in the Print dialog are valid only for the current print job that you start by clicking the Print button. If you want to change some options permanently, open Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME (application name) - Print.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156080				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>To set the default \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> printer options for text documents, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1099E				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>To set the default \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> printer options for spreadsheet documents, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060700.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Calc - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CD				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>To set the default \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>printer options for presentation documents, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070400.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Impress - Print\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200901194137				0	ga	Press Shift+F1 or choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help - What's This?\</item\> and point to any control element in the Print dialog to see an extended help text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912284914				0	ga	Preview				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id081820091228505				0	ga	The preview shows how each sheet of paper will look. You can browse through all sheets of paper with the buttons below the preview.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285056				0	ga	General				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285064				0	ga	On the General tab page, you find the most important control elements for printing. You can define which contents of your document are to be printed. You can select the printer and open the printer settings dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Prints the entire document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
