helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id4313791				0	ga	Bánspásanna				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4331797				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies how whitespaces are to be handled when a string of the current data type is being processed. Possible values are Preserve, Replace, and Collapse. The sematics follow the definition at http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#rf-whiteSpace.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id4191717				0	ga	Patrún				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id2318796				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies a regular expression pattern. Strings validated against the data type must conform to this pattern to be valid. The XSD data type syntax for regular expressions is different from the regular expression syntax used elseswhere in %PRODUCTNAME, for example in the Find & Replace dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
