helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010601.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	ga	You can use this dialog to edit, to add, or to delete entries from the conversion dictionary. The file path name for the conversion dictionary is user/wordbook/commonterms.ctd. You cannot delete the default entries in this file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
