helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149575				0	ga	Effects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	ga	The following capitalization effects are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922				0	ga	Without - no effect is applied				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154280				0	ga	Capitals - changes the selected lowercase characters to uppercase characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148947				0	ga	Lowercase - changes the selected uppercase characters to lower characters				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	ga	Title font - changes the first character of each selected word to an uppercase character				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154937				0	ga	Small capitals - changes the selected lowercase characters to uppercase characters, and then reduces their size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154129				0	ga	Relief				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_CHAR_EFFECTS_LB_RELIEF\"\>Select a relief effect to apply to the selected text. The embossed relief makes the characters appear as if they are raised above the page. The engraved relief makes the characters appear as if they are pressed into the page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
