helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B3				0	ga	Tagged PDF contains information about the structure of the document contents. This can help to display the document on devices with different screens, and when using screen reader software.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
