helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	ga	Convert Common Terms				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10599				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Converts words with two or more characters that are in the list of common terms. After the list is scanned, the remaining text is converted character by character.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
