helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CB				0	ga	This label of this button changes to \<emph\>Resume\</emph\> if you leave the Spellcheck dialog open when you return to your document. To continue the spellcheck from the current position of the cursor, click \<emph\>Resume\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
