helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Automatically creates a numbered list when you press Enter at the end of a line that starts with a number followed by a period, a space, and text. If a line starts with a hyphen (-), a plus sign (+), or an asterisk (*), followed by a space, and text, a bulleted list is created when you press Enter.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146874				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>To cancel automatic numbering when you press Enter at the end of a line that starts with a numbering symbol, press Enter again.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	ga	The automatic numbering option is only applied to paragraphs that are formatted with the "Default", "Text body", or "Text body indent" paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
