helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Automatically replaces the "Default" paragraph style with the Heading 1 to Heading 8 paragraph styles. To apply the Heading 1 paragraph style, type the text that you want to use as a heading (without a period), and then press Enter twice. To apply a sub-heading, press Tab one or more times, type the text (without a period), and then press Enter.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151075				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Remove blank paragraphs\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
