helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DE				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether to print the type of meeting line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E1				0	ga	Please read				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E5				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether to print a Please read line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E8				0	ga	Please bring				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EC				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether to print a Please bring line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EF				0	ga	Nótaí				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F3				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether to print a Notes line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Go to Agenda Wizard - Names\"\>Go to Agenda Wizard - Names\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Web Wizard - Main Layout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10544				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/webwizard03.xhp\"\>Web Wizard - Main Layout\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10554				0	ga	Select the formatting template that you want to use for the layout of the index page of your site. The template defines the text formatting and the position of elements on the page. Some of the available layouts use frames.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	ga	Leaganacha Amach				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055B				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"34220\"\>Select the layout for the index page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard03.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/webwizard04.xhp\"\>Web Wizard - Layout details\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Treoraí Láithreoireachta				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159224				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>wizards; presentations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>presentations; wizards\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159224				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Presentation Wizard\"\>Presentation Wizard\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	ga	\<variable id=\"autopilot\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_AUTOPILOT\"\>Use the wizard to interactively create a presentation. With the wizard, you can modify the sample templates to suit your needs.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The wizard takes you step by step through the design elements and offers various editing options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289				0	ga	The Presentation Wizard starts automatically when you open a new presentation. You can deactivate this function if you choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</link\>\</emph\> and deselect the \<emph\>Start with Wizard\</emph\> check box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ga	Within each wizard page, you can undo, modify, or skip altogether the editing steps. If you decide to skip over one of the pages, the wizard uses the default settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
