helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156307				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_ASS:BUT_NEXT\"\>Accepts the new settings and moves to the next page.\</ahelp\> You will not be able to select this button in the last editing step.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
