helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10577				0	ga	The wizard can be called any time from the Help menu. The wizard will be offered automatically starting five days before the evaluation period expires.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	ga	The wizard consists of the following steps:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	ga	Purchase %PRODUCTNAME				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is the welcome page of the wizard. If you want to buy a serial number online, click the button. If you already have a serial number, click Next to enter the number on the next page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	ga	Get your serial number online				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to enter a web page, where you can purchase a serial number online.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	ga	Unlock %PRODUCTNAME				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A7				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enter your serial number or copy and paste the number from the online web page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105B6				0	ga	Comhaontú um Cheadúnas				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BA				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Please read the license text (scroll down the text accordingly), then accept the license to continue unlocking. If you do not accept the license, the software will not be unlocked.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C9				0	ga	Sonraí Pearsanta				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CD				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This step of the wizard appears when the unlocking program finds an installed version of %PRODUCTNAME where some user settings can be copied to the new installation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
