helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055C				0	ga	The Start-up Wizard opens when you start %PRODUCTNAME for the first time.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055F				0	ga	The wizard consists of the following pages:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	ga	Fáilte				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10566				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Start-up Wizard helps you to specify the user settings for %PRODUCTNAME. This wizard only runs once.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10575				0	ga	License				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10579				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read and accept the license text to continue. You need to scroll to the end of the license text before you can continue. If you decline the license, the installation is canceled.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN10588				0	ga	Migration				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058C				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can use this page to import user data from a previously installed version of %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
