helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\startup.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Copies the user name and other data from a previous %PRODUCTNAME installation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
