helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153116				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Icons in the Documentation\"\>Icons in the Documentation\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	ga	Icons in the Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	ga	There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	ga	The "Important!" icon points out important information regarding data and system security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	ga	The "Note" icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	ga	The "Tip" icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
