helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154939				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_BOOKMARKS\"\>Adds this page to your bookmarks\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D9				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id7358623\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_recsearch.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7358623\"\>Search icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN108FE				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TOOLBOXITEM_SEARCHDIALOG\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Find on this page\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	ga	These commands can also be found in the context menu of the Help document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10922				0	ga	Help Page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10926				0	ga	You can copy from the Help Viewer to the clipboard on your operating system with standard copy commands. For example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092C				0	ga	On a Help page, select the text that you want to copy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10930				0	ga	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10933				0	ga	To search the current Help page:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10939				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10940				0	ga	The \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> dialog opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A36				0	ga	You can also click in the Help page and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A22				0	ga	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter the text that you want to find.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A48				0	ga	Select the search options that you want to use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A26				0	ga	Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A59				0	ga	To find the next occurrence of the search term on the page, click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10906				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:ComboBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the text that you want to search for or select a text entry in the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10993				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WHOLEWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds complete words only.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109AA				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_MATCHCASE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Distinguishes between uppercase text and lowercase text.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C1				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_WRAPAROUND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches the entire Help page, starting at the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D8				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:CheckBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:CB_BACKWARDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Searches backwards from the current position of the cursor.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN109F5				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:PushButton:RID_DLG_SEARCH:PB_FIND\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Finds the next occurrence of the search term.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149202				0	ga	Navigation Pane				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148673				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_TABCONTROL\"\>The navigation pane of the Help window contains the tab pages \<emph\>Contents\</emph\>, \<emph\>Index\</emph\>, \<emph\>Find\</emph\> and \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159149				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_LISTBOX\"\>The list box located at the very top is where you can select other \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help modules.\</ahelp\> The \<emph\>Index\</emph\> and \<emph\>Find\</emph\> tab pages only contain the data for the selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Contents\"\>Contents\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	ga	Displays an index of the main topics of all modules.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	ga	Displays a list of index keywords for the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154188				0	ga	Allows you to carry out a full-text search. The search will include the entire Help contents of the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> module.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154985				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Bookmarks\"\>Bookmarks\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156062				0	ga	Contains user-defined bookmarks. You can edit or delete bookmarks, or click them to go to the corresponding pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Getting Support				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143272				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>support on the Web\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>getting support\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>forums and support\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>Web support\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146873				0	ga	\<variable id=\"00000001\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000001.xhp\" name=\"Getting Support\"\>Getting Support\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id9173253				0	ga	Many questions and answers are the same for OpenOffice.org software and for the commercial office software.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150667				0	ga	You can find support on the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	ga	For a summary of the current support services refer to the \<emph\>Readme\</emph\> file in the \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> folder.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id26327				0	ga	Local language support pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id1318380				0	ga	The OpenOffice.org localization projects offer support pages in local languages. Find an overview of the native language projects at \<link href=\"http://projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\"\>projects.openoffice.org/native-lang.html\</link\>. You can find help and support in English language on the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://support.openoffice.org\"\>support.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2611386				0	ga	Mailing lists				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3166335				0	ga	Ask about OpenOffice.org, find help by volunteers, and discuss topics on the public mailing lists. You can find many general and specialized mailing lists on the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\"\>www.openoffice.org/mail_list.html\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0915200811081722				0	ga	Forum				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200811081778				0	ga	You can access web forums to ask and answer questions about OpenOffice.org.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0804200803314150				0	ga	Slándáil				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0804200803314235				0	ga	In case you are concerned about any security issue with using this software, you can contact the developers on the public mail list dev@openoffice.org. If you want to discuss any issue with other users, send an email to the public mail list discuss@openoffice.org.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168534				0	ga	Downloads				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3028143				0	ga	You can download the latest version of OpenOffice.org at \<link href=\"http://download.openoffice.org/\"\>download.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id2602967				0	ga	Documentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3497211				0	ga	You can download documentation as PDF files, how-tos, and guides from the OpenOffice.org website at \<link href=\"http://documentation.openoffice.org\"\>documentation.openoffice.org\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id0120200910361765				0	ga	Participate and give back				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361848				0	ga	If you want to take an active role in the worldwide OpenOffice.org community, you are very welcome to give feedback, discuss features, propose enhancements, write your own article in an FAQ, how-to, manual, create a video tutorial, etc.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id0120200910361874				0	ga	Visit the \<link href=\"http://documentation.openoffice.org/\"\>documentation web site\</link\> or the \<link href=\"http://wiki.services.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation\"\>Wiki starting page\</link\> and follow the links for contributors.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Managing Bookmarks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153244				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>Help; bookmarks\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bookmarks; Help\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154349				0	ga	\<variable id=\"doc_title\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000150.xhp\" name=\"Managing Bookmarks\"\>Managing Bookmarks\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3154840				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_EDIT_DLG_HELP_ADDBOOKMARK_ED_BOOKMARK_TITLE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the name of the bookmarked page. You can also type a new name for the bookmark.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140				0	ga	\<image src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\" id=\"img_id3149549\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149549\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	ga	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	ga	You can find the bookmarks on the \<emph\>Bookmarks\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ga	Use the Del key to delete a selected bookmark.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	ga	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	ga	\<emph\>Display\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>displays the selected help subject\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	ga	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	ga	\<emph\>Delete\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_DELETE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>deletes the bookmark selected \</ahelp\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	ga	The Help references the default settings of the program on a system that is set to defaults. Descriptions of colors, mouse actions, or other configurable items can be different for your program and system.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150618				0	ga	The \<emph\>$[officename] Help system\</emph\> provides easy access to information and support. There are several ways to find what you are looking for in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"Help environment\"\>Help environment\</link\>: You can search for a specific keyword in the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000130.xhp\" name=\"Index\"\>Index\</link\>, carry out a full-text search under \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find\"\>Find\</link\>, or look through a hierarchical list of the \<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000160.xhp\" name=\"Topics\"\>Topics\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Find - The Full-Text Search				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148532				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>Find tab in Help\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help; full-text search\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>full-text search in Help\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148523				0	ga	\<variable id=\"00000140\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000140.xhp\" name=\"Find - The Full-Text Search\"\>Find - The Full-Text Search\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155599				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_COMBOBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the search term here. The search is not case-sensitive.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to start a full-text search for the term you entered.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_LB_RESULT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the headings of the pages found in your full-text search. To display a page, double-click its entry.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_FULLWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to carry out an exact search for the word you entered. Incomplete words will not be found.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_SCOPE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to only search in document headings for the search term.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_PUSHBUTTON_TP_HELP_SEARCH_PB_OPEN_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the entry selected in the list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3152552				0	ga	The full text search function in $[officename] Help allows you to find Help documents that contain any combination of search terms. To do this, type one or more words into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	ga	The \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text field stores the words you entered last. To repeat a previous search, click the arrow icon and select the term from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	ga	After the search has been carried out, the document headings of the results appear in a list. Either double-click an entry, or select it and click \<emph\>Display\</emph\> to load the corresponding Help document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	ga	Use the check box \<emph\>Find in headings only\</emph\> to limit the search to document headings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	ga	The \<emph\>Complete words only\</emph\> check box allows you to perform an exact search. If this box is marked, incomplete words will not be found. Do not mark this check box if the search term you enter should also be found as part of a longer word.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798				0	ga	You can enter any combination of search terms, separated by spaces. Searching is not case-sensitive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	ga	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected %PRODUCTNAME application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Design Mode On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151100				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170500.xhp\" name=\"Design Mode On/Off\"\>Design Mode On/Off\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150040				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SwitchControlDesignMode\"\>Toggles the Design mode on or off. This function is used to switch quickly between \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Design\"\>Design\</link\> and User mode. Activate to edit the form controls, deactivate to use the form controls.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153528				0	ga	Please note the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171000.xhp\" name=\"Open in Design Mode\"\>\<emph\>Open in Design Mode\</emph\>\</link\> function. If \<emph\>Open in Design Mode\</emph\> is activated, the document is always opened in Design mode, regardless of the state in which it is saved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	ga	If your form is linked to a database and you turn off the Design mode, the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Form Bar\"\>Form Bar\</link\> is displayed at the lower margin of the document window. You can edit the link to the database in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170201.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07090000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Easpórtáil mar PDF go díreach				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146946				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/07090000.xhp\" name=\"Export Directly as PDF\"\>Export Directly as PDF\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3085157				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ExportDirectToPDF\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Exports the current document directly as PDF. No settings dialog is shown.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Show Draw Functions				2002-02-02 02:02:02
