helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152989				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:VerticalText\"\>Draws a text box with vertical text direction where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text. You can also move the cursor to where you want to add the text, drag a text box, and then type or paste your text. Only available when Asian language support is enabled.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
