helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149388				0	ga	IONSÁ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	ga	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	ga	FORSCR				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	ga	In the overwrite mode, any existing text is replaced by new text. The cursor is displayed as a thick vertical line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
