helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154873				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070400.xhp\" name=\"New Document\"\>New Document\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445				0	ga	Use the \<emph\>New Document\</emph\> tab from the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\> to set up a hyperlink to a new document and create the new document simultaneously.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152594				0	ga	New Document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	ga	Specifies the name, path and type of the new document in this area.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151226				0	ga	Edit now				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_NEWDOCUMENT:RB_EDITNOW\"\>Specifies that the new document is created and immediately opened for editing.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
