helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UseWizards\"\>Specifies whether to start the wizard automatically when inserting a new control.\</ahelp\> This setting applies globally to all documents.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	ga	There are wizards for inserting a list box or combo box, a table element and group boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154228				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170901.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\"\>Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	ga	Specifies a table from the available database tables that contains the data field whose content should be displayed as a list entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	ga	For list boxes, a table that can be linked with the current form table is indicated. The link table must have at least one field in common with the table of the current form. This makes it possible to establish an unambiguous reference.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	ga	For combo boxes, there must be a relationship between the form table and the table containing the data to be displayed in the combo box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	ga	Table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338	7			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_LCW_CONTENTSELECTION_TABLE_LB_SELECTTABLE\"\>In the\<emph\> Table \</emph\>field, select the table containing the data field whose content should be displayed in the control field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	ga	The table given here appears in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control properties\"\>Control properties\</link\> as an element of an SQL statement in the \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\> field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
