helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150499				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170202.xhp\" name=\"Events\"\>Events\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147043				0	ga	The\<emph\> Events \</emph\>tab page, allows you to assign a macro to certain events which occur in a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	ga	To link an event with a macro, first write a macro that contains all the commands to be executed when the event happens. Then assign this macro to the respective event by clicking the \<emph\>... \</emph\>button beside the corresponding event. The\<emph\> Assign Macro \</emph\>dialog opens, where you can select the macro.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149182				0	ga	The following actions can be configured individually, meaning that you can use your own dialogs to depict an action:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	ga	Displaying an error message,				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	ga	Confirming a delete process (for data records),				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153541				0	ga	Querying parameters,				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155261				0	ga	Checking input when saving a data record.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	ga	For example, you can issue a "confirm deletion" request such as "Really delete customer xyz?" when deleting a data record.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id0409200920562590				0	ga	The events that are shown in the Events dialog cannot be edited directly. You can delete an event from the list by pressing the Del key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150986				0	ga	The following lists and describes all events in a form that can be linked to a macro:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147559				0	ga	Before update				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Before update event occurs before the control content changed by the user is written into the data source.\</ahelp\> The linked macro can, for example, prevent this action by returning "FALSE".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153779				0	ga	After update				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_AFTERUPDATE\"\>The After update event occurs after the control content changed by the user has been written into the data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157909				0	ga	Roimh athshocrú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390	51			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVERESETTED\"\>The\<emph\> Prior to reset \</emph\>event occurs before a form is reset.\</ahelp\> The linked macro can, for example, prevent this action by returning "FALSE".				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149236				0	ga	A form is reset if one of the following conditions is met:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	ga	The user presses an (HTML) button that is defined as a reset button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153666				0	ga	A new and empty record is created in a form that is linked to a data source. For example, in the last record, the \<emph\>Next Record\</emph\> button may be pressed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156119				0	ga	I ndiaidh athshocrú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563	55			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_RESETTED\"\>The\<emph\> After resetting \</emph\>event occurs after a form has been reset.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150870				0	ga	Sula gcuirtear isteach				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3159152	28			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_SUBMITTED\"\>The\<emph\> Before submitting \</emph\>event occurs before the form data is sent.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149167				0	ga	Agus á luchtú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423	6			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_LOADED\"\>The\<emph\> When loading \</emph\>event occurs directly after the form has been loaded.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	ga	Roimh athluchtú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	39			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_RELOADING\"\>The\<emph\> Before reloading \</emph\>event occurs before the form is reloaded.\</ahelp\> The data content has not yet been refreshed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155102				0	ga	Agus á athluchtú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3157895	41			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_RELOADED\"\>The\<emph\> When reloading \</emph\>event occurs directly after the form has been reloaded.\</ahelp\> The data content has already been refreshed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152792				0	ga	Sula ndíluchtaítear				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598	43			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_UNLOADING\"\>The\<emph\> Before unloading \</emph\>event occurs before the form is unloaded; that is, separated from its data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154145				0	ga	Agus á dhíluchtú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	45			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_UNLOADED\"\>The\<emph\> When unloading \</emph\>event occurs directly after the form has been unloaded; that is, separated from its data source.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147426				0	ga	Dearbhaigh dealú				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154988	26			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CONFIRMDELETE\"\>The\<emph\> Confirm deletion \</emph\>event occurs as soon as data has been deleted from the form.\</ahelp\> For example, the linked macro can request confirmation in a dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149481				0	ga	Sula bhfeidhmítear gníomh an taifead				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156007	58			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEROWCHANGE\"\>The\<emph\> Before record action \</emph\>event occurs before the current record is changed.\</ahelp\> For example, the linked macro can request confirmation in a dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145749				0	ga	I ndiaidh feidhmiú gníomh an taifead				2002-02-02 02:02:02
