helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	ga	Set left indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154307				0	ga	Drag the bottom left mark to the right while pressing the mouse button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
