helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154142				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"Form Controls\"\>Form Controls\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151378				0	ga	\<variable id=\"formulartext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Config\"\>The Form Controls toolbar contains tools that you need to create an interactive form.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can use the toolbar to add controls to a form in a text, spreadsheet, presentation, or HTML document, for example a button that runs a macro.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id1027200809391346				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars - Form Controls\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	ga	Icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar (you may need to enable this initially invisible icon):				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155341				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3150943\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_config.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150943\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	ga	Form Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B21				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/xforms.xhp\"\>XML Form documents\</link\> (XForms) use the same controls.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	ga	To create a form, open a document and use the Form Controls toolbar to add and define the form controls. If you want, you can also link the form to a database, so that you can use the controls to manipulate a database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	ga	When you create a form in an HTML document, you can use the form to send data over the Internet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	ga	%PRODUCTNAME only exports the form properties that are supported by the HTML version that you export to. To specify the HTML version, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML Compatibility\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C39				0	ga	To add a control to a document				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154918				0	ga	On the Form Controls toolbar, click the icon of the control that you want to add.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C4D				0	ga	In the document, drag to create the control. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C50				0	ga	To create a square control field, hold down the Shift key while you drag.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154127				0	ga	To add a field from the field list of a table or query to a form, drag a cell into the form. In a text document, you can also drag a column header to add a field to a form. To include a label for the field, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift key down when you drag a column head.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C87				0	ga	Modifying a Control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645				0	ga	Right-click the control and choose \<emph\>Control\</emph\>. A dialog opens where you can define the properties of the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	ga	To specify a accelerator key for a control, add a tilde (~) in front of the character in the label for the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152792	135			0	ga	You can drag and drop controls from one document to another document. You can also copy and paste controls between documents. When you insert a control from another document, $[officename] analyzes the data source, content type, and content properties of the control so that the control fits the logical structure in the target document. For example, a control that displays contents from an address book continues to display the same contents after you copy the control to a different document. You can view these properties on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of the \<emph\>Form properties\</emph\> dialog. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154411				0	ga	Select				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156106				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3153516\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawselect.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153516\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150470				0	ga	This icon switches the mouse pointer to the select mode, or deactivates this mode. The select mode is used to select the controls of the current form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146914				0	ga	Check Box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148483				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3156380\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_checkbox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156380\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153927				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CheckBox\"\>Creates a check box.\</ahelp\> Check boxes allow you to activate or deactivate a function in a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153794				0	ga	Bosca Téacs				2002-02-02 02:02:02
