helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158444				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Edit\"\>Creates a text box.\</ahelp\> Text boxes are fields in which the user can enter text. In a form, text boxes display data or allow for new data input.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151218				0	ga	Formatted Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154836				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3143277\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formattedfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3143277\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147547				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormattedField\"\>Creates a formatted field.\</ahelp\> A formatted field is a text box in which you can define how the inputs and outputs are formatted, and which limiting values apply.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155346				0	ga	A formatted field has \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170002.xhp\" name=\"special control properties\"\>special control properties\</link\> (choose \<emph\>Format - Control\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148774				0	ga	Cnaipe Ordaithe				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3151073\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpushbutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151073\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147046				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Pushbutton\"\>Creates a push button.\</ahelp\> This function can be used to execute a command for a defined event, such as a mouse click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	ga	You can apply text and graphics to these buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157844				0	ga	Cnaipe Rogha				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3152999\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_radiobutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152999\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149123				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RadioButton\"\>Creates an option button.\</ahelp\> Option buttons enable the user to choose one of several options. Option buttons with the same functionality are given the same name (\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\>\<emph\>property\</emph\>). Normally, they are given a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"group box\"\>group box\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156064				0	ga	List Box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154326				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3154135\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_listbox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154135\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ListBox\"\>Creates a list box.\</ahelp\> A list box lets users select an entry from a list. If the form is linked to a database and the database connection is active, the\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170900.xhp\" name=\"List Box Wizard\"\>\<emph\>List Box Wizard\</emph\>\</link\> will automatically appear after the list box is inserted in the document. This wizard helps you create the list box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147171				0	ga	Combo Box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149981				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3148817\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_combobox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148817\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149407				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ComboBox\"\>Creates a combo box.\</ahelp\> A combo box is a single-line list box with a drop-down list from which users choose an option. You can assign the "read-only" property to the combo box so that users cannot enter other entries than those found in the list. If the form is bound to a database and the database connection is active, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170900.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box Wizard\"\>\<emph\>Combo Box Wizard\</emph\>\</link\> will automatically appear after you insert the combo box in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145618				0	ga	Réimse Lipéid				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145295				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3151017\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertfixedtext.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151017\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Label\"\>Creates a field for displaying text.\</ahelp\> These labels are only for displaying predefined text. Entries cannot be made in these fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CC6				0	ga	More Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CDC				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/more_controls.xhp\"\>\<emph\>More Controls\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CF7				0	ga	Form Design				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10D0D				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0226.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Form Design\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B57				0	ga	Wizards On/Off				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B65				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id6128727\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_usewizards.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6128727\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B76				0	ga	Turns on and turns off the automatic form controls wizards.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id6403088				0	ga	These wizards help you to enter the properties of list boxes, table controls, and other controls.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149436				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170001.xhp\" name=\"Context Menu Commands\"\>Context Menu Commands\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A56				0	ga	Spin Button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A64				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id7816400\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_spinbutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7816400\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A75				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpinButton\"\>Creates a spin button.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id710776				0	ga	If you add a spin button to a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between the spin button and a cell. As a result, when you change the contents of a cell, the contents of the spin button are updated. Conversely, if you change the value of the spin button, the contents of the cell are updated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ABC				0	ga	Scrollbar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ACA				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id8203985\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_scrollbar.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id8203985\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ADB				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ScrollBar\"\>Creates a scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CA3				0	ga	You can specify the following properties for a scrollbar:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CDA				0	ga	UI name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE0				0	ga	Semantics				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE7				0	ga	Scroll value min				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CED				0	ga	Specifies the minimum height or the minimum width of a scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CF4				0	ga	Scroll value max				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CFA				0	ga	Specifies the maximum height or the maximum width of a scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D01				0	ga	Default scroll value				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D07				0	ga	Specifies the default value of a scrollbar, used when the form is reset.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D0E				0	ga	Orientation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D14				0	ga	Specifies the orientation of a scrollbar, that is, horizontal or vertical.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D1B				0	ga	Small change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D21				0	ga	Specifies the minimum amount by which you can scroll a scrollbar, for example, by clicking an arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D28				0	ga	Large change				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	ga	Specifies the amount that a large step scrolls a scrollbar, for example, when you click between the scrollbar thumb and a scrollbar arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	ga	Delay				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	ga	Specifies the delay in milliseconds between scrollbar trigger events. For example, the delay that occurs when you click an arrow button on the scrollbar and hold down the mouse button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D42				0	ga	Symbol color				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D48				0	ga	Specifies the color of the arrows on the scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D4F				0	ga	Visible Size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D55				0	ga	Specifies the size of the scrollbar thumb in "value units". For example, a value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min.") / 2 results in a scrollbar thumb that occupies half of the scrollbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D58				0	ga	To make the width of the scrollbar equal to the height of the scrollbar, set the Visible Size to zero.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D63				0	ga	In a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between a scrollbar and a cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153316				0	ga	Image Button				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159622				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3154378\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_imagebutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154378\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148601				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Imagebutton\"\>Creates a button displayed as an image.\</ahelp\> Aside from the graphic representation, an image button has the same properties as a "normal" button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159171				0	ga	Image Control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155869				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3152381\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_objectcatalog.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152381\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImageControl\"\>Creates an image control. It can only be used to add images from a database.\</ahelp\> In the form document, double-click one of these controls to open the \<emph\>Insert Graphic\</emph\> dialog to insert the image. There is also a context menu (not in design mode) with commands for inserting and deleting the image.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150318				0	ga	Images from a database can be displayed in a form, and new images can be inserted in the database as long as the image control is not write-protected. The control must refer to a database field of the image type. Therefore, enter the data field into the properties window on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156040				0	ga	Date Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149423				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3150096\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_adddatefield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150096\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DateField\"\>Creates a date field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the date values can be adopted from the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151302				0	ga	If you assign the "Dropdown" property to the date field, the user can open a calendar to select a date under the date field. This also applies to a date field within a Table Control field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395				0	ga	Date fields can be easily edited by the user with the up arrow and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the day, month, or the year is can be increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170003.xhp\" name=\"Specific Remarks on Date Fields\"\>Specific Remarks on Date Fields\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152369				0	ga	Time Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153687				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3155949\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_timefield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155949\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155399				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TimeField\"\>Creates a time field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the time values for the form can be adopted from the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154764				0	ga	Time fields can be easily edited by the user with the up and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the hours, minutes, or the seconds are increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156186				0	ga	File Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150531				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3154344\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_filecontrol.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154344\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FileControl\"\>Creates a button that enables file selection.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154652				0	ga	Numerical Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
