helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:LastPage\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves to the last page of the document.\</ahelp\> This function is only active when you select the \<emph\>Page Preview\</emph\> function on the \<emph\>File\</emph\> menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
