helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156153				0	ga	An áit ina ndéanfar an cuardach				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	ga	Specifies the fields for the search.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154564				0	ga	Form				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159176				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXDLG_SEARCHFORM_LB_FORM\"\>Specifies the logical form in which you want the search to take place.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155434	107			0	ga	The\<emph\> Form \</emph\>combo box is only visible if the current document is a form document with more than one logical form. It does not appear during a search in tables or queries.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151384				0	ga	Form documents may contain multiple logical forms. These are individual form components, which are each linked to a table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145086				0	ga	The \<emph\>Form\</emph\> combo box contains the names of all logical forms for which controls exist.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159414				0	ga	Gach Réimse				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_ALLFIELDS\"\>Searches through all fields.\</ahelp\> If you are running a search in a table, all fields in the table will be searched. If you are running a search in a form, all fields of the logical form (entered under \<emph\>Form\</emph\>) will be searched. If you are running a search in a table control field, all columns that are linked to a valid database table field will be searched.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	ga	Note that the fields of the current logical form do not have to be identical to the fields of the form document. If the form document contains fields that point to multiple data sources (that is, multiple logical forms), the \<emph\>All Fields\</emph\> option will only search for the fields linked to data sources in the form document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150865				0	ga	Réimse aonair				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_SEARCHFORM_RB_SINGLEFIELD\"\>Searches through a specified data field.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154365				0	ga	Socruithe				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3158408				0	ga	Defines settings to control the search.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
