helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	ga	The following comparative operators can be set under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Standard Filter\</item\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313	3			0	ga	                  \<emph\>Comparative operator\</emph\>               				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089	4			0	ga	                  \<emph\>Effect\</emph\>               				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	ga	Equal (=)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	ga	Shows values equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	ga	Less than (<)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	ga	Shows values less than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807				0	ga	Greater than (>)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	ga	Shows values greater than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	ga	Less than or equal to (< =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381				0	ga	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	ga	Greater than or equal to (> =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	ga	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	ga	Not equal (< >)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	ga	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	ga	Largest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	ga	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) largest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	ga	Smallest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	ga	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) smallest values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	ga	Largest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161645				0	ga	Shows the largest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the total values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202				0	ga	Smallest %				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	ga	Shows the smallest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the entire values.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
