helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148566	143			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_WIDTH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the column width in the table control field.\</ahelp\>Sets the column width in the table control field in the units that are specified in the %PRODUCTNAME module options. If you want, you can enter a value followed by a valid measurement unit, for example, 2 cm.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
