helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12156				0	ga	Scagadh / Sórtáil				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1215A				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"37931\"\>Specifies to show or hide the filtering and sorting items in a selected Navigation Bar control.\</ahelp\> Filtering and sorting items are the following: Sort ascending, Sort descending, Sort, Automatic filter, Default filter, Apply filter, Remove filter/sort.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
