helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12318				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the size of scrollbar thumb in "value units". A value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min." ) / 2 would result in a thumb which occupies half of the background area.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN12375				0	ga	If set to 0, then the thumb's width will equal its height.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
