helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	ga	Some shapes have a special handle which you can drag to change the properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
