helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152473	71			0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the\<emph\> Next \</emph\>button, and the wizard uses the current dialog settings and proceeds to the next step. If you are on the last step, this button becomes \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
