helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	ga	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Open\</item\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AF				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> icon on the Standard toolbar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
