helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id0202200910470118				0	ga	Bullets and Numbering of paragraphs is supported only in Writer, Impress and Draw.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3153527\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_removebullets.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153527\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
