helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	ga	To define the line attributes and direction, use the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> drawing object as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\line_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3156113				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3166410\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertdraw.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3166410\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
