helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\mobiledevicefilters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148389				0	ga	After these steps you can copy documents between $[officename] and your Pocket PC, either by the ActiveSync software or by the Windows Explorer. The filters will be applied to the document files automatically.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copy_drawfunctions.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Copying Drawing Objects Into Other Documents				2002-02-02 02:02:02
