helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136	1			0	ga	\<variable id=\"gallery_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/gallery_insert.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Objects From the Gallery\"\>Inserting Objects From the Gallery\</link\> \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	ga	You can insert an object in a document either as a \<emph\>copy\</emph\> or as a \<emph\>link\</emph\>. A copy of an object is independent of the original object. Changes to the original object have no effect on the copy. A link remains dependent on the original object. Changes to the original object are also reflected in the link.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145313				0	ga	Inserting an object as a copy				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	ga	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154306				0	ga	Select a theme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154516				0	ga	Select an object using a single click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	ga	Drag the object into the document, or right-click to open the context menu and select \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and \<emph\>Copy\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153061				0	ga	Inserting an object as a link				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	ga	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	ga	Select a theme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	ga	Select an object by a single click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140				0	ga	Drag the object into the document while pressing the Shift and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>keys, or right-click to open the context menu and select \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and \<emph\>Link\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156282				0	ga	Inserting an object as a background graphic				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152920				0	ga	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	ga	Select a theme.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607				0	ga	Select an object by a single click.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
