helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	ga	To protect the changes made in a document during editing, choose \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Protect Records\</emph\>. To turn off the function or to accept or reject changes it is necessary to enter the correct password first.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
