helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_doctypes.xhp	0	help	par_id3152780				0	ga	To change the association of Microsoft Office file name extensions to open the files either in $[officename] or in Microsoft Office, using Microsoft Windows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
