helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_doctypes.xhp	0	help	par_id0815200803314243				0	ga	If these steps do not apply to your brand of Microsoft Windows, search your Microsoft Windows Help for instructions how to change the file associations.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
