helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153295				0	ga	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down Arrow opens a combo box. Enter selects the current entry in the combo box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
