helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3154367				0	ga	The $[officename] document inside the Internet Explorer shows a set of read-only toolbar icons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Edit file\</emph\> icon in the document's toolbar to open a copy of the document in a new $[officename] window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
