helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_DBASE_INDEXES_IB_ADD\"\>Moves the selected index to the \<emph\>Table Indexes\</emph\> list.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
