helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	ga	Réimsí i gceist				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148994				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies two data fields that will be joined by a relation.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
