helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147340				0	ga	Type				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_QRY_JOINTYPE\"\>Specifies the link type of the selected link.\</ahelp\> Some databases support only a subset of the possible types.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155334				0	ga	Inner Join				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155936				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_QRY_JOINTYPE\"\>With the internal join, the results table contains only the records for which the content of the linked fields is the same.\</ahelp\> In $[officename] SQL this type of link is created by a corresponding WHERE clause.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156372				0	ga	Left Join				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3166450				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_QRY_JOINTYPE\"\>With the left join, the results table contains all fields of the left table and only those fields of the right table for which the content of the linked fields is the same.\</ahelp\> In $[officename] SQL this type of link corresponds to the LEFT OUTER JOIN command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155607				0	ga	Right Join				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150647				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_QRY_JOINTYPE\"\>With the right join, the results table contains all fields of the right table and only those fields of the left table for which the content of the linked fields is the same.\</ahelp\> In $[officename] SQL this type of link corresponds to the RIGHT OUTER JOIN command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158215				0	ga	Full Join				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3163665				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_QRY_JOINTYPE\"\>For a full join, the results table contains all fields of the left and right tables.\</ahelp\> In the SQL of $[officename] this type of link corresponds to the FULL OUTER JOIN command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id0305200912031976				0	ga	Nádúrtha				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id0305200912031977				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Inserts the keyword NATURAL into the SQL statement that defines the relation. The relation joins all columns that have the same column name in both tables. The resulting joined table contains only one column for each pair of equally named columns.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
