helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\main.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E7				0	ga	The database file contains queries, reports, and forms for the database as well as a link to the database where the records are stored. Formatting information is also stored in the database file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
