helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155374				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Polygon\"\>Draws a closed shape consisting of straight line segments. Click where you want to start the polygon, and drag to draw a line segment. Click again to define the end of the line segment, and continue clicking to define the remaining line segments of the polygon. Double-click to finish drawing the polygon. To constrain the polygon to angles of 45 degree, hold down Shift when you click.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
