helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextFitToSizeTool\"\>Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. The text that you enter is automatically resized to fit the dimensions of the text box.\</ahelp\> Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145826				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3153038\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_textfittosizetool.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153038\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
