helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145596				0	ga	Callouts				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153006				0	ga	Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout from where you drag in the current document. The text direction is horizontal. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150019				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3153738\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawcaption.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153738\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
