helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151185				0	ga	Set to circle (slant)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150766				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CrookSlant\"\>Distorts the selected object by wrapping it around imaginary circles. Drag a handle of the selected object to distort it.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150875				0	ga	\<image id=\"img_id3150882\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_crookrotate.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150882\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
