helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ArrowsToolbox\"\>Open the \<emph\>Arrows\</emph\> toolbar, where you can add straight lines, lines with arrows, and dimension lines to the current slide or page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10120000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071F				0	ga	If you want, you can add an arrow after you draw a line by choosing Format - Line, and then selecting an arrow style from the Style box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
