helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3145086				0	ga	In \<emph\>Normal\</emph\> view, select the slide that you want to add the transition effect to.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3150655	70			0	ga	On the \<emph\>Tasks\</emph\> pane, click \<emph\>Slide Transition\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
