helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3148826	49			0	ga	If you want, you can use the \<emph\>Zoom\</emph\> toolbar \<image id=\"img_id3151172\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_zoom.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151172\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to change the view magnification for the slides.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3154269	78			0	ga	On the Tasks pane, click Slide Transition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3154102				0	ga	Select a slide transition from the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3153785				0	ga	To preview the transition effect for a slide, click the small icon underneath the slide on the \<emph\>Slides Pane\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149341				0	ga	To remove a transition effect				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3151287				0	ga	In \<emph\>Slide Sorter\</emph\> View, select the slides that you want to remove the transition effect from.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
