helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153415				0	ga	\<variable id=\"vectorize\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/vectorize.xhp\" name=\"Converting Bitmap Images into Vector Graphics\"\>Converting Bitmap Images into Vector Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155633				0	ga	A vector graphic can be resized without losing the quality of the graphic. In $[officename] Draw and Impress, you can convert a bitmap image into a vector graphic.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241				0	ga	Select the bitmap image that you want to convert.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	ga	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	ga	In $[officename] Draw, choose \<emph\>Modify - Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	ga	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
