helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018				0	ga	\<variable id=\"change_scale\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/change_scale.xhp\" name=\"Zooming With the Keypad\"\>Zooming With the Keypad\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3148487				0	ga	You can use the keypad to quickly enlarge or reduce the view on your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id3149501				0	ga	To zoom in, press the Plus Sign.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
