helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\change_scale.xhp	0	help	par_id7954954				0	ga	If you are using a mouse with a scroll wheel, you can hold down Ctrl and turn the wheel to change the zoom factor in all main modules of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
