helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150521				0	ga	\<variable id=\"now\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_now.xhp\"\>NOW\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id3148829				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_JETZT\"\>Returns the computer system date and time.\</ahelp\> The value is updated when you recalculate the document or each time a cell value is modified.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146988				0	ga	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id3154897				0	ga	NOW()				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id4598529				0	ga	NOW is a function without arguments.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154205				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_now.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOW()-A1\</item\> returns the difference between the date in A1 and now. Format the result as a number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Protecting Sheet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153087				0	ga	Protecting Sheet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	ga	\<variable id=\"tabelletext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>Protects the cells in the current sheet from being modified.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Choose \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Protect Sheet\</emph\> dialog in which you then specify sheet protection with or without a password.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	ga	To protect cells from further editing, the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> check box must be checked on the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05020600.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cells - Cell Protection\"\>\<emph\>Format - Cells - Cell Protection\</emph\>\</link\> tab page or on the \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> context menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490	8			0	ga	Unprotected cells or cell ranges can be set up on a protected sheet by using the \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet\</emph\> and \<emph\>Format - Cells - Cell Protection\</emph\> menus: 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149123				0	ga	Select the cells that will be unprotected				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	ga	Select \<emph\>Format - Cells - Cell Protection\</emph\>. Unmark the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384				0	ga	On the \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet\</emph\> menu, activate protection for the sheet. Effective immediately, only the cell range you selected in step 1 can be edited.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149566	9			0	ga	To later change an unprotected area to a protected area, select the range. Next, on the \<emph\>Format - Cells - Cell Protection\</emph\> tab page, check the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> box. Finally, choose the \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet \</emph\>menu. The previously editable range is now protected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153964				0	ga	Sheet protection also affects the context menu of the sheet tabs at the bottom of the screen. The \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> and \<emph\>Rename\</emph\> commands cannot be selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150301				0	ga	If a sheet is protected, you will not be able to modify or delete any Cell Styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	ga	A protected sheet or cell range can no longer be modified until this protection is disabled. To disable the protection, choose the \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet\</emph\> command. If no password was set, the sheet protection is immediately disabled. If the sheet was password protected, the \<emph\>Remove Protection\</emph\> dialog opens, where you must enter the password.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149815				0	ga	Once saved, protected sheets can only be saved again by using the \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\> command.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150206				0	ga	Password (optional)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152990				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>Allows you to enter a password to protect the sheet from unauthorized changes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148700				0	ga	Complete protection of your work can be achieved by combining both options on the \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document\</emph\> menu, including password protection. To prohibit opening the document altogether, in the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> dialog mark the \<emph\>Save with password\</emph\> box before you click the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
