helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	ga	\<variable id=\"zellenrechtstext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCELL:BTN_CELLSRIGHT\"\>Moves the contents of the selected range to the right when cells are inserted.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
