helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Combines the selected cells into a single cell or splits merged cells.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	ga	The merged cell receives the name of the first cell of the original cell range. Merged cells cannot be merged a second time with other cells. The range must form a rectangle, multiple selection is not supported.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
