helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id8337046				0	ga	Select the range that includes the hidden objects. You can also use the box in the corner above row 1 and beside column A. For sheets, this step is not necessary.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id5532090				0	ga	Choose \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05030400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Row/Column - Show\"\>Format - Row/Column - Show\</link\> or \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05050300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sheet - Show\"\>Format - Sheet - Show\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
