helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	ga	Settlement date: February 7 1999, maturity date: June 15 1999, last interest: October 15 1998. Interest rate: 3.75 per cent, yield: 4.05 per cent, redemption value: 100 currency units, frequency of payments: half-yearly = 2, basis: = 0				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148567				0	ga	The price per 100 currency units per value of a security, which has an irregular last interest date, is calculated as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332				0	ga	=ODDLPRICE("1999-02-07";"1999-06-15";"1998-10-15"; 0.0375; 0.0405;100;2;0) returns 99.87829.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
