helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150134				0	ga	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145245				0	ga	\<emph\>LastInterest\</emph\> is the last interest date of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
