helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146894				0	ga	2001-05-12				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3143231				0	ga	5000				2002-02-02 02:02:02
