helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3153974				0	ga	\<variable id=\"complex\"\>\<emph\>ComplexNumber\</emph\> is a complex number that is entered in the form "x+yi" or "x+yj".\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149697				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3143222	50			0	ga	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=IMABS("5+12j")\</item\> returns 13.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
