helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200903061174				0	ga	Information units "bit" and "byte" may also be prefixed by one of the following IEC 60027-2 / IEEE 1541 prefixes:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
