helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3152893				0	ga	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> calculates the type of difference. Possible values are 0 (interval) and 1 (in calendar years).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
