helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3146155				0	ga	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic cotangent is Number.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5818659				0	ga	An error results if Number is between -1 and 1 inclusive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083452				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150608				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ACOTH(1.1)\</item\> returns inverse hyperbolic cotangent of 1.1, approximately 1.52226.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145084				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>ASIN function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
