helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_COSHYP\"\>Returns the hyperbolic cosine of a number.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
