helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149969				0	ga	 Returns the (trigonometric) cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, the angle in radians.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3444624				0	ga	To return the cotangent of an angle in degrees, use the RADIANS function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6814477				0	ga	The cotangent of an angle is equivalent to 1 divided by the tangent of that angle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
