helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148616				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COT(PI()/4)\</item\> returns 1, the cotangent of PI/4 radians.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148986				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COT(RADIANS(45))\</item\> returns 1, the cotangent of 45 degrees.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
