helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144754				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COTH(1)\</item\> returns the hyperbolic cotangent of 1, approximately 1.3130.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
