helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3156340				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=EXP(1)\</item\> returns 2.71828182845904, the mathematical constant e to Calc's accuracy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145781				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>FACT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>factorials;numbers\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
