helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152986				0	ga	\<variable id=\"texttext\"\>This section contains descriptions of the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> functions.\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149384				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>ARABIC function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
