helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151362	58			0	ga	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> refers to text in which spaces are removed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146838				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156074	60			0	ga	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=TRIM("hello")\</item\> returns hello.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
