helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id0907200904022588				0	ga	UNICODE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200904022594				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Returns the numeric code for the first Unicode character in a text string.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id0907200904123874				0	ga	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
