helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknum.xhp	0	help	par_id3150704				0	ga	=WEEKNUM("1995-01-01";1) returns 1				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknum.xhp	0	help	par_id3149792				0	ga	=WEEKNUM("1995-01-01";2) returns 52. If the week starts on Monday, Sunday belongs to the last week of the previous year.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
