helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148735				0	ga	\<variable id=\"yearfrac\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_yearfrac.xhp\"\>YEARFRAC\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
