helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874	28			0	ga	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FORECAST(50;A1:A50;B1;B50)\</item\> returns the Y value expected for the X value of 50 if the X and Y values in both references are linked by a linear trend.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
