helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3156067	54			0	ga	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=STANDARDIZE(11;10;1)\</item\> returns 1. The value 11 in a normal distribution with a mean of 10 and a standard deviation of 1 is as much above the mean of 10, as the value 1 is above the mean of the standard normal distribution.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
