helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D1				0	ga	You can also insert a list box from the Controls toolbar and link the list box to a cell. This way you can specify the valid values on the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\"\>Data\</link\> page of the list box properties window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
