helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145078				0	ga	Select the desired style from the Styles and Formatting window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159098				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Fill Format Mode\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148609				0	ga	Click a cell to format it, or drag your mouse over a certain range to format the whole range. Repeat this action for other cells and ranges.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	ga	Click the \<emph\>Fill Format Mode\</emph\> again to exit this mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
