helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DataFilterRemoveFilter\"\>Removes the filter from the selected cell range. To enable this command, click inside the cell area where the filter was applied.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
