helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150132	18			0	ga	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NOT(A)\</item\>. If A=TRUE then NOT(A) will evaluate FALSE.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>OR function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
