helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546				0	ga	When a function expects a single value, but you entered a cell range, then the value from the cell range is taken that is in the same column or row as the formula.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027				0	ga	If the entered range is outside of the current column or row of the formula, the function returns the error value #VALUE!				2002-02-02 02:02:02
