helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819	24			0	ga	            \<emph\>LogicalValue1; LogicalValue2 ...LogicalValue30\</emph\> are conditions to be checked. All conditions can be either TRUE or FALSE. If a range is entered as a parameter, the function uses the value from the range that is in the current column or row.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154870				0	ga	The logical values of entries 12<11; 13>22, and 45=45 are to be checked.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
