helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108B2				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Filter dialog.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108C9				0	ga	Enable drill to details				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108CD				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select this check box and double-click an item label in the table to show or hide details for the item. Clear this check box and double-click a cell in the table to edit the contents of the cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E0				0	ga	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E6				0	ga	Select a range of cells and choose \<emph\>Data - Group and Outline - Show Details\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108EE				0	ga	Double-click a field in the table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_idN108F1				0	ga	If you double-click a field which has adjacent fields at the same level, the \<emph\>Show Detail\</emph\> dialog opens:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
