helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3157871				0	ga	\<emph\>Number1, Number2,...Number30\</emph\> are values or ranges that represent a sample. Each number can also be replaced by a reference.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149725				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153122				0	ga	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=AVEDEV(A1:A50)\</item\>         				2002-02-02 02:02:02
