helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145138				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MITTELWERTA\"\>Returns the average of the arguments. The value of a text is 0.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
