helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153933				0	ga	MODE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153085				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MODALWERT\"\>Returns the most common value in a data set.\</ahelp\> If there are several values with the same frequency, it returns the smallest value. An error occurs when a value doesn't appear twice.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
