helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155437				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NEGBINOMVERT\"\>Returns the negative binomial distribution.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
