helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153044				0	ga	\<emph\>X\</emph\> represents the value returned for unsuccessful tests.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3151018				0	ga	\<emph\>R\</emph\> represents the value returned for successful tests.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3148878				0	ga	\<emph\>SP\</emph\> is the probability of the success of an attempt.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
