helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_OSTERSONNTAG\"\>Returns the date of Easter Sunday for the entered year.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
