helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154692				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>ISNONTEXT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cell contents;no text\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
