helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146992				0	ga	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is any value or expression where a test is performed to determine whether it is a text or numbers or a Boolean value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150525				0	ga	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149906				0	ga	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNONTEXT(D2)\</item\> returns FALSE if cell D2 contains the text \<item type=\"input\"\>abcdef\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
