helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3541062				0	ga	If an error occurs, the function returns FALSE.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149162				0	ga	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148918				0	ga	ISLOGICAL(Value)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146946				0	ga	Returns TRUE if \<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a logical value (TRUE or FALSE), and returns FALSE otherwise.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
