helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_timevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632	168			0	ga	         \<item type=\"input\"\>=TIMEVALUE("24:00")\</item\> returns 1. If you use the HH:MM:SS time format, the value is 00:00:00.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
