helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	ga	You can also use the mouse to split the window horizontally or vertically. To do this, drag the thick black line located directly above the vertical scrollbar or directly to the right of the horizontal scrollbar into the window. A thick black line will show where the window is split.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263				0	ga	A split window has its own scrollbars in each partial section; by contrast, \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/07090000.xhp\" name=\"fixed window sections\"\>fixed window sections\</link\> are not scrollable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
