helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id9947508				0	ga	In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7907956				0	ga	Choose the border options you want to apply and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1342204				0	ga	The options in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area can be used to apply multiple border styles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
