helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153361				0	ga	\<variable id=\"mark_cells\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/mark_cells.xhp\" name=\"Selecting Multiple Cells\"\>Selecting Multiple Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145272				0	ga	Select a rectangular range				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3149261				0	ga	With the mouse button pressed, drag from one corner to the diagonally opposed corner of the range.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151119				0	ga	Mark a single cell				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	ga	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3163710				0	ga	Click, then Shift-click the cell.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959				0	ga	Pressing the mouse button, drag a range across two cells, do not release the mouse button, and then drag back to the first cell. Release the mouse button. You can now move the individual cell by drag and drop.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154942				0	ga	Select various dispersed cells				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id1001200901072060				0	ga	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284				0	ga	Mark at least one cell. Then while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, click each of the additional cells.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id1001200901072023				0	ga	Click the STD / EXT / ADD area in the status bar until it shows ADD. Now click all cells that you want to select.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146971				0	ga	Switch marking mode				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\mark_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064				0	ga	On the status bar, click the box with the legend STD / EXT / ADD to switch the marking mode:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
