helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Printing Sheets in Landscape Format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153418				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>printing; sheet selections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sheets; printing in landscape\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>printing; landscape\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>landscape printing\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153418				0	ga	\<variable id=\"print_landscape\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/print_landscape.xhp\" name=\"Printing Sheets in Landscape Format\"\>Printing Sheets in Landscape Format\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257				0	ga	In order to print a sheet you have a number of interactive options available under \<emph\>View - Page Break Preview\</emph\>. Drag the delimiter lines to define the range of printed cells on each page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	ga	To print in landscape format, proceed as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	ga	Go to the sheet to be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3150786				0	ga	Choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3150089	5			0	ga	The command is not visible if the sheet has been opened with write protection on. In that case, click the \<emph\>Edit File \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3166430				0	ga	Select the \<emph\>Page\</emph\> tab. Select the \<emph\>Landscape\</emph\> paper format and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3150885				0	ga	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3156288				0	ga	Depending on the printer driver and the operating system, it may be necessary to click the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> button and to change your printer to landscape format there.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3149404	9			0	ga	In the \<emph\>Print \</emph\>dialog in the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page, select the contents to be printed:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3153305	10			0	ga	               \<emph\>All sheets\</emph\> - All sheets will be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3148871	12			0	ga	               \<emph\>Selected sheets\</emph\> - Only the selected sheets will be printed. All sheets whose names (at the bottom on the sheet tabs) are selected will be printed. By pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> while clicking a sheet name you can change this selection.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3764763				0	ga	               \<emph\>Selected cells\</emph\> - All selected cells are printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id5538804				0	ga	From all the paper pages that result from the above selection, you can select the range of paper pages to be printed:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id14343				0	ga	               \<emph\>All pages\</emph\> - Print all resulting pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699	11			0	ga	               \<emph\>Pages\</emph\> - Enter the pages to be printed. The pages will also be numbered from the first sheet onwards. If you see in the Page Break Preview that Sheet1 will be printed on 4 pages and you want to print the first two pages of Sheet2, enter 5-6 here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_landscape.xhp	0	help	par_id3145076				0	ga	If under \<emph\>Format - Print ranges\</emph\> you have defined one or more print ranges, only the contents of these print ranges will be printed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
