helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148774				0	ga	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:METRICFIELD:RID_FONTSIZEDIALOG:4\"\>Select the size for text in a formula relative to the base size.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
