helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090904.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	ga	Here is an example of how to create a matrix with varying font sizes in \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\>. You can copy this example to the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window using the clipboard and use it in your own formula.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
