helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153545	74			0	ga	To create the \<emph\>much greater than\</emph\> relation with two placeholders, type \<emph\><?> gg <?> \</emph\>or \<emph\>>>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
