helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154735				0	ga	When entering information manually in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window, note that a number of operators require spaces for the correct structure. This is especially true if you are working with values instead of placeholders. For example, for the "is considerably greater" relation, type either \<emph\>10 gg 1\</emph\> or \<emph\>a gg b\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090903.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Symbols with Indices				2002-02-02 02:02:02
