helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	ga	The selection window is divided into two parts. Clicking a symbol at the top of the window displays its subordinate symbols in the lower half of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153250				0	ga	You can access the same functions in submenus through the context menu of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
