helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	ga	Returns the default context of the process service factory, if existent, else returns a null reference. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10593				0	ga	This runtime function returns the default component context to be used, if instantiating services via XmultiServiceFactory. See the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Professional UNO\</item\> chapter in the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Developer's Guide\</item\> on \<link href=\"http://api.openoffice.org\"\>api.openoffice.org\</link\> for more information.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
