helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153127				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030104.xhp\" name=\"Month Function [Runtime]\"\>Month Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	ga	Returns the month of a year from a serial date that is generated by the DateSerial or the DateValue function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
