helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	ga	Returns a value that represents the day of the month based on a serial date number generated by \<emph\>DateSerial\</emph\> or \<emph\>DateValue\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
