helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	ga	Converts a string to a numeric expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159157				0	ga	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	ga	Val (Text As String)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
