helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03103450.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	ga	Dimensions a variable or an array at the global level (that is, not within a subroutine or function), so that the variable and the array are valid in all libraries and modules for the current session.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
