helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030202.xhp\" name=\"Minute Function [Runtime]\"\>Minute Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	ga	Returns the minute of the hour that corresponds to the serial time value that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
