helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080201.xhp\" name=\"Exp Function [Runtime]\"\>Exp Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	ga	Returns the base of the natural logarithm (e = 2.718282) raised to a power.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
