helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153346				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030204.xhp\" name=\"Second Function [Runtime]\"\>Second Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030204.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	ga	Returns an integer that represents the seconds of the serial time number that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
