helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	ga	Returns the access mode or the file access number of a file that was opened with the Open statement. The file access number is dependent on the operating system (OSH = Operating System Handle).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
