helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090407.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	ga	You can use the single quotation mark instead of the Rem keyword to indicate that the text on a line is comments. This symbol can be inserted directly to the right of the program code, followed by a comment.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
