helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	ga	Method of the com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener interface				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	ga	elementReplaced:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	ga	Method of the com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener interface				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	ga	In this example, the prefix is ContListener_. The following subroutines must therefore be implemented in Basic:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	ga	ContListener_disposing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	ga	ContListener_elementInserted				2002-02-02 02:02:02
