helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	ga	Returns a \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000003.xhp#farbcodes\" name=\"long integer color value\"\>long integer color value\</link\> consisting of red, green, and blue components.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147229				0	ga	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	ga	RGB (Red, Green, Blue)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
