helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155114				0	ga	The dialog shows a list of all existing objects in a hierarchical representation. Double-clicking a list entry opens its subordinate objects.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
