helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090410.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894				0	ga	The \<emph\>Switch\</emph\> function evaluates the expressions from left to right, and then returns the value that is assigned to the function expression. If expression and value are not given as a pair, a runtime error occurs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
