helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\insert_control.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797	2			0	ga	Use the tools on the \<emph\>Toolbox \</emph\>of the BASIC dialog editor to add controls to your dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\insert_control.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276				0	ga	To open the \<emph\>Toolbox\</emph\>, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Insert Controls\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
