helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717				0	ga	Please note that problems may arise in displaying labels if the size of your chart is too small. You can avoid this by either enlarging the view or decreasing the font size.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
