helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	ga	\<variable id=\"titel\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ZTitle\"\>Modifies the properties of the selected title.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149378				0	ga	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Character\"\>Character\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Chart Type Pie 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	bm_id7621997				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>donut charts\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pie charts;types\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>chart types;pie/donut\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	hd_id3365276				0	ga	\<variable id=\"type_pie\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_pie.xhp\"\>Chart Type Pie\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id245979				0	ga	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	hd_id5799432				0	ga	Pióg				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id6549272				0	ga	A pie chart shows values as circular sectors of the total circle. The length of the arc, or the area of each sector, is proportional to its value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id6529740				0	ga	Pie - this subtype shows sectors as colored areas of the total pie, for one data column only. In the created chart, you can click and drag any sector to separate that sector from the remaining pie or to join it back.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id9121982				0	ga	Exploded pie - this subtype shows the sectors already separated from each other. In the created chart, you can click and drag any sector to move it along a radial from the pie's center.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id3808404				0	ga	Donut - this subtype can show multiple data columns. Each data column is shown as one donut shape with a hole inside, where the next data column can be shown. In the created chart, you can click and drag an outer sector to move it along a radial from the donut's center.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_pie.xhp	0	help	par_id2394482				0	ga	Exploded donut - this subtype shows the outer sectors already separated from the remaining donut. In the created chart, you can click and drag an outer sector to move it along a radial from the donut's center.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Chart Type Net				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	bm_id2193975				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>net charts\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>chart types;net\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>radar charts, see net charts\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	hd_id1990722				0	ga	\<variable id=\"type_net\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/01/type_net.xhp\"\>Chart Type Net\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id40589				0	ga	On the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart Wizard\</link\> you can choose a chart type. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	hd_id1391338				0	ga	Líon				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id7812433				0	ga	A Net chart displays data values as points connected by some lines, in a grid net that resembles a spider net or a radar tube display.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_net.xhp	0	help	par_id3512375				0	ga	For each row of chart data, a radial is shown on which the data is plotted. All data values are shown with the same scale, so all data values should have about the same magnitude.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ga	Suí				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150869				0	ga	\<bookmark_value\>positioning; axes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>charts;positioning axes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>X axes;positioning\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Y axes;positioning\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>axes;interval marks\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
